Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:00:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 51/54] POC-16b: Custom screen slides in and out, chosen chips
 ride above the Pokemon, Program Advances form on screen

- The Custom window slides in over 12 frames and back out over 10 after OK (TUNE).
- In the fight the queued chips stack above the player's Pokemon (BN shows them over MegaMan's
  head), the next one in front; a PA shows its finisher's icon with a flashing rim.
- At OK a Program Advance forms: the three chips converge, flash, and become the PA's card
  (replaces the flash banner). Sounds: SE_WIN_OPEN on open, SE_RG_BAG_CURSOR on undo,
  SE_RG_POKE_JUMP_SUCCESS when a PA forms (was SE_EXP_MAX).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
